sponsible for their own traffic logging."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}]}],"style":"warning","name":"Warning"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Custom backends","anchor":"Custom-backends"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Labels identify categories, such as "},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these as "},{"code":"key=value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/GettingStarted":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Prepare your project to connect to the YubiKey via NFC, SmartCard, Lightning and USB HID."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/gettingstarted","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Getting Started"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/Logs":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs","url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/logs","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configures logging for YubiKit connections and sessions."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","t